## Original Content
Plus grand salon européen du jeu vidéo, la Gamescom réunit cette année à Cologne plus de 1600 exposants et doit présenter plus de 800 jeux.

## Summary
Gamescom 2026, the largest European video game expo, is set to open with major titles like Final Fantasy VII Revelation and the return of The Witcher 3. The event in Cologne will gather over 1600 exhibitors and showcase more than 800 games.

## Key Points
- Gamescom is the biggest video game event in Europe.
- The event will be held in Cologne in 2026.
- Over 1600 exhibitors are expected to participate.
- More than 800 games will be presented.
- Notable games include Final Fantasy VII Revelation and The Witcher 3.


